    {
      "name": "places/ChIJO6ccWQCqQjQRlD4wgKxecCM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsWVp6SnVXRFZTUkhwaFRqUnBXa1JUY0dOWWVYYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 個月前",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "It’s a proper old-school, family-run noodle joint, tucked away on a street corner. The prices and food are spot on. Everyone seems to order the fried tofu—it’s dead fresh and comes with a sauce that’s got a lovely kick without being too salty. The sesame noodles are something else; the sauce is so thick you don't even need to toss them, and the noodles have a proper bite to them. Absolutely brilliant—it’s the kind of place that keeps you coming back for more.\n\n古早味家庭式麵店，在巷口轉角。價格和味道很實在，炸豆腐很新鮮，配上帶著不死鹹的醬，幾乎每一桌都有點。麻醬麵不需要拌開就有非常濃厚的醬汁，麵條是有勁道的陽春麵，吃起來很過癮。味道非常棒而且會令人想再三回訪的店。",
        "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "It’s a proper old-school, family-run noodle joint, tucked away on a street corner. The prices and food are spot on. Everyone seems to order the fried tofu—it’s dead fresh and comes with a sauce that’s got a lovely kick without being too salty. The sesame noodles are something else; the sauce is so thick you don't even need to toss them, and the noodles have a proper bite to them. Absolutely brilliant—it’s the kind of place that keeps you coming back for more.\n\n古早味家庭式麵店，在巷口轉角。價格和味道很實在，炸豆腐很新鮮，配上帶著不死鹹的醬，幾乎每一桌都有點。麻醬麵不需要拌開就有非常濃厚的醬汁，麵條是有勁道的陽春麵，吃起來很過癮。味道非常棒而且會令人想再三回訪的店。",
        "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
      },
